You can use a **Group** component in `FormLayout.json` to group several fields together, and then apply dynamics to the **group** instead of each field individually. A group is defined by giving it an `id`, `type: "Group"`, and a `children` list containing the component IDs you want included in the group. [2]

Example: [2]

```json
[
  {
    "id": "<unique-id>",
    "type": "Group",
    "children": [
      "field1",
      "field2"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "field1",
    "type": "Input",
    "textResourceBindings": {
      "title": "Field 1"
    },
    "dataModelBindings": {
      "simpleBinding": "field1"
    },
    "required": true
  },
  {
    "id": "field2",
    "type": "Input",
    "textResourceBindings": {
